1. BUSINESS PROFILE & STATUS
- Core business model, primary target audience, and main value proposition.
- Website health evaluation (e.g., if fetch failed, site is missing, outdated, or lacks modern UX/lead capture).

2. OPPORTUNITY IDENTIFICATION
